{
  "$comment": [
    "Every file one release publishes, the install types that update from each, and its",
    "SHA256SUMS.txt, for the version below. Owned by openavc: tests/test_release_assets.py holds",
    "the release workflow's names and checksum list to it, and the updater's readers. A built",
    "file's bytes are its own name, so each hash in sha256sums is the SHA-256 of that name.",
    "installed_by names each install in its own words: its deployment type and what",
    "platform.system() and platform.machine() return there. kind is artifact_kind's word for",
    "that install type; null for a file no install updates from.",
    "checksum_list is the published file sha256sums is the text of.",
    "final_release_adds: what release-pi.yml uploads to a final release afterwards, spelled with this",
    "version; no installed system updates from them, and SHA256SUMS.txt never lists them.",
    "Renaming a release file: change the workflow, this list and the updater together."
